@title: An element whose properties are not what the snapshot expects does not break the page
# YouTube's tabs keep the selected tab's index in `selected`; after a click on
# 'Videos' it was 1, and every step on the page failed with "cannot unmarshal
# number into … is_selected of type bool".
STEP 1: Use the page
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/oddprops.html
    CLICK the 'Shorts' tab
    VERIFY that 'Showing Shorts' is present
    CLICK the 'Videos' tab
    VERIFY that 'Showing Videos' is present
    VERIFY that 'Third place' is present
DONE.
